{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113836","id":3088959293,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc64Hcc9","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113836","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113836.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113836.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113836","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113836/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113836/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113836/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/c7cacf97d78260d39816301c9d9eea52b7130e1a","number":113836,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Core: Add `BIND` macro for strongly typed enums","user":{"login":"Kimau","id":905911,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNTkxMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/905911?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau","html_url":"https://github.com/Kimau","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Currently, the existing BIND_ENUM_CONSTANT macro relies on implicit\r\nconversion to integers. This works for standard C-style enums but\r\nfails to compile with C++11 scoped enums (enum class), which require\r\nexplicit casting.\r\n\r\nThis commit adds a static_cast to int64_t, enabling support for \r\nmodern, strictly typed C++ enums.\r\nYou want to use the modern C++11 enums to enable strict typing and \r\nconform memory layouts.\r\n\r\nNOTE: This change must be implemented in core/object/class_db.h as it\r\nmodifies the base binding macros. It cannot be implemented as an addon\r\nor GDExtension.\r\n\r\n--- Example ---\r\n```cpp\r\nenum MyState { IDLE, RUN, WALK };\r\nBIND_ENUM_CONSTANT(IDLE); // Works\r\n\r\nenum class MyStateClass : uint8_t { IDLE, RUN, WALK };\r\nBIND_ENUM_CONSTANT(MyStateClass::IDLE); // Now Works!\r\n```","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_